title: pickup_prompt
---
<<declare $pickup_success = true as bool>>
Pick up [item]{$item_name}[/item]?
-> Yes
    <<try_pickup>>
    <<jump pickup_result>>
-> No
===

title: pickup_result
---
<<if $pickup_success>>
[item]{$item_name}[/item] recogido.
-> Ok
<<else>>
No hay espacio para [item]{$item_name}[/item].
-> Ok
<<endif>>
===
